From 7619db583178073a3ef008bbfae13374bebe967d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 18:07:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] provenance: build guard and run-suite print HEAD, tree
 and UTC time first; short SHA in log names

build-wechat-guarded.sh: first line '== GUARD HEAD=<sha> tree=<tree> short=<7> utc=<Z> target=...';
each Creator log starts with the same HEAD/tree/utc line and is named <out>.<short>.tryN.log;
the old <out>.tryN.log is kept as a symlink to it so existing readers and copy steps still work;
final PASSED line also carries HEAD/tree. Selftest case 1b covers header, log header, SHA name
and the legacy link.
run-suite.cjs: first stdout line '== SUITE HEAD=... tree=... short=... utc=... node=...';
suite.json gains gitTree, gitShort, startedAtUTC (gitHead/startedAt unchanged) and is also written
as reports/suite.<short>.json (gitignored, so the guard's clean-tree check is unaffected).
Per-test <id>.stdout/stderr.txt names unchanged.
